@AstreeClaims_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5294
@ClaimId = CLM-REMPLACER

### SQL Server health
GET {{AstreeClaims_Api_HostAddress}}/api/health/database

### FastAPI health
GET {{AstreeClaims_Api_HostAddress}}/api/health/ai

### Claims
GET {{AstreeClaims_Api_HostAddress}}/api/claims?page=1&pageSize=20

### Claim context
GET {{AstreeClaims_Api_HostAddress}}/api/claims/{{ClaimId}}/context

### S4A - generate a summary draft
POST {{AstreeClaims_Api_HostAddress}}/api/claims/{{ClaimId}}/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "generationType": "summary",
  "userInstruction": "Rester factuel et concis."
}

### S4A - generation history
GET {{AstreeClaims_Api_HostAddress}}/api/claims/{{ClaimId}}/generations
